Note that this code block assumes that the real-time database query function is implemented in a separate file, and that the `queryTransactionDatabase` function takes a transaction ID list as input. Also note that the `authenticateClient` and `getAccessToken` functions are thread-safe, but the `queryTransactionDatabase` function may not be thread-safe if it modifies the transaction ID list in place.

