The `GetHash` method takes in a string input and a hash algorithm name (either "MD5", "SHA1", or "SHA256"), and returns the generated hash in hexadecimal format using the specified hash algorithm.

The class also includes a dictionary of supported hash algorithms, which is initialized with the MD5, SHA1, and SHA256 hash algorithms. The `GetHash` method uses this dictionary to retrieve the appropriate hashing algorithm based on the user input.

