To optimize performance, this implementation uses a semaphore to control the concurrency level and ensures resource management to avoid overwhelming system resources. Each external API call should include a valid authentication token for secure access. The function should return the final reduced value, or an error if one occurs, while adhering to all the given constraints and scenarios.

