The function uses a `mutex` to ensure thread safety when accessing the shared data structure (the forward list). This is important because multiple threads may be accessing the same data simultaneously.

The function also handles errors gracefully by using exceptions for unexpected situations, such as attempting to insert an element into a full list or attempting to find a non-existent element in the list.

