The class is designed to be thread-safe and capable of handling concurrent connection requests up to the specified concurrency level. It uses a mutex to ensure that only one thread can access the connection at any given time, and it uses an atomic boolean variable to track whether the connection is established or not. The class also implements a retry mechanism with exponential backoff to handle transient errors, respecting the maximum retries setting while ensuring the system does not become unresponsive.

