The function also supports different website types (e.g., ASP.NET Core, .NET Framework) and ensures compatibility with various hosting environments (e.g., IIS, Kubernetes). It detects and handles external dependencies required by the websites, provides a fallback strategy in case some dependencies are not available, optimizes performance, writes comprehensive unit tests to cover all possible scenarios, and implements thread safety to allow for concurrent operations.

In addition, this code is designed with user-friendly interfaces for input validation and error messages, customizable logging levels, and support for different hosting environments and third-party services.

