The `handleConcurrentAccess` function uses a mutex to lock the external data sources during concurrent access and handles any exceptions that occur during the operation by retrying the operation up to three times with a delay between attempts. The `logErrorAndHandleException` function logs an error to a file or console output and handles an exception by retrying the operation up to three times with a delay between attempts.

