The `cleanup_directories` function periodically scans for old directories that are no longer referenced by the environment variable and cleans them up according to the retention policy.

The `create_nested_directory` function creates a new nested directory with a specified structure based on date and time, and sets an environment variable to the path of the created directory.

The `log_operation` function logs all operations and errors, and supports custom logging levels (debug, info, warn, error).

The `get_metadata` function retrieves metadata about a directory with the given name.

